SparkClaw Browser Bridge 1.0.16 is derived from Microsoft Playwright's
packages/extension at commit 260eae31113073927b93c5c7591b5ae039952dd0
(Playwright Extension 0.4.0).

The relay protocol, connection lifecycle, and tab-group behavior retain the
upstream design. SparkClaw modifications enforce attachment-time task-tab
authorization, suppress ordinary foreground activation, remove owner-tab
selection and drag-in attachment, and add an explicit one-shot handoff marker.

